    "你的名字": {
      "comment": "The title of an alert that appears when adding a new member to a group.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your name"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的名字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你選擇的身份會綁定到這個裝置，其他成員會看到你做的變更。未被選擇的成員是「幽靈成員」，任何人都能幫他代記帳。": {
      "comment": "A footer text explaining the behavior of \"ghost members\".",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The identity you pick is tied to this device, and other members will see the changes you make. Members nobody has picked are “ghost members” — anyone can add expenses on their behalf."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你選擇的身份會綁定到這個裝置，其他成員會看到你做的變更。未被選擇的成員是「幽靈成員」，任何人都能幫他代記帳。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如：週五晚餐": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "e.g. Friday dinner"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如：週五晚餐"
